# Live backend: mems-backend

There is **no** `backend/` folder in this repo.

All API / PHP / DB work goes only here:

`C:\xampp\htdocs\mems-backend`

- Frontend Vite proxies `/api` → `http://127.0.0.1/mems-backend`
- Health: `http://127.0.0.1/mems-backend/api/health`
- Seed: `npm run db:seed` or `C:\xampp\php\php.exe C:\xampp\htdocs\mems-backend\scripts\seed.php`
